                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \omega(\phi)
              is horizontally conserved on solutions:
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
