            %em antifield complex
            in the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/BV-BRST+formalism"} BV-BRST formulation
            of derived phase spaces.
          %p (…)
          %h2#related_concepts Related concepts
          %div
            %p
              Reductions of (
